      "player": "Haiku Stoic",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "I'm at the end of turn 5 cleanup and need to discard down to 7 cards. I have 8 cards. Current hand shows: Epic Experiment, Forger's Foundry, Pongify, Volcanic Torrent, Galvanic Iteration, Crackling Spellslinger, Veyran, Haughty Djinn.\n\
\n\
I'm at 34 hp and taking significant damage. I should think about what I need:\n\
- **Veyran** (1UR, 2/2) - good tempo play and enables spell copying\n\
- **Haughty Djinn** (1UU, 0/4) - defensive, flying blocker\n\
- **Crackling Spellslinger** (3RR, 2/2) - solid body but expensive\n\
- **Epic Experiment** (XUR) - card draw/selection, very useful\n\
- **Pongify** (U) - removal/tempo\n\
- **Forger's Foundry** (2U) - mana acceleration/filtering\n\
- **Galvanic Iteration** (RR) - spell copy\n\
- **Volcanic Torrent** (4R) - removal\n\
\n\
I'll discard **Volcanic Torrent** since it's expensive and less immediately impactful than the others.",
