      "player": "Sonnet Timmy",
      "decision_index": 310,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Failed to activate Cryptic Caves to draw a card at end of turn with unused mana. Sonnet Timmy controls 8 lands (meeting the 5+ requirement) and has untapped Plains to pay the {1} cost. With an Island in hand ready to play next turn, sacrificing the colorless-only Cryptic Caves for a card draw is good value.",
