      "player": "Sonnet Timmy",
      "decision_index": 310,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to crack Evolving Wilds when there was no reason not to. Cracking it during the beginning phase means the fetched land enters tapped now and will be available untapped on the next turn. It's pure upside - deck thinning and mana fixing at no cost.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to activate any abilities, leaving Evolving Wilds uncracked.",
