      "description": "Declined to activate Evolving Wilds, which is a free mana-fixing/deck-thinning activation with no downside. In a 1v1 situation against Sonnet Timmy, getting an untapped basic land and thinning the deck is pure upside.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without activating any abilities",
