    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to crack Evolving Wilds for a free land fetch, missing deck thinning and mana fixing. With expensive cards in hand like Wild Ricochet (2RR) and Terra Ravager (2RR), getting an extra land onto the battlefield is valuable.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to activate Evolving Wilds (chose False)",
