    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Discarded Terra Ravager, one of the best remaining threats that could swing for 8+ damage, while keeping Tempt with Reflections which requires a creature on the battlefield (Libby has none). Terra Ravager would have served as both a body and a significant damage source.",
      "action_taken": "Discarded Terra Ravager",
