      "decision_index": 325,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to activate Evolving Wilds during upkeep, missing an opportunity to get an additional basic land onto the battlefield. Since the player has a land in hand (Dimir Guildgate or Island) to play as their normal land drop, sacrificing Evolving Wilds would effectively ramp them from 8 to 9 lands, which helps cast multiple spells or higher-cost spells in upcoming turns.",
