    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With both Propaganda and Ghostly Prison on the battlefield taxing attacks against Grok4F Libby (the sole remaining opponent), exiling only one tax effect still leaves a {2}-per-creature attack tax. At 8 lands, paying {2} per attacker significantly limits combat pressure. Spiteful Visions, while annoying, is manageable at 21 life and could even be used strategically.",
